          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation during a trip of a rather elongated, bluish shape at the level of the vehicle's headlights; continuous back-and-forth movement; very likely observation of a disco laser.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "0764f1af3f60105f5443b004d9c7e4102eca84051d0aefc50db752fbbc46ecbe"
